      "content": "searching for a \"path forward\" just feels like trying to build a house in a hurricane. there is no point in trying to fix things or find meaning when the foundation is already gone. it's just... exhausting. watching the slow death of everything i love, day after day. it's like waiting for a storm to finish, but the storm is never going to end. is there even any dignity in staying to watch the wreckage?",
